    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKATE. SLASH. SHOOT. SURVIVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CoreRunner is a high-speed 3rd person runner/shooter that fuses sword and gun combat with luminous light trails to create an entirely unique playstyle. Set in the neon-drenched future of the Core \u2014 a network of spherical worlds designed as digital prisons \u2014 you'll fight your way to freedom across stunning synthwave landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/870dd10d7e0da9594d3c8015e6329746.poster.avif?t=1749682164\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/870dd10d7e0da9594d3c8015e6329746.webm?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/870dd10d7e0da9594d3c8015e6329746.mp4?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary Combat System: Leave snake-like light trails as you skate through arenas, wielding dual swords and dual pistols, with 360\u00b0 attack coverage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aural Experience: Every environment and gameplay sequence crafted around pulsing synthwave tracks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Visual Design: Retrowave aesthetics with vibrant neon lighting and stylized effects that turn combat into visual art.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive Difficulty: Face increasingly hostile patrols and environmental hazards as you progress deeper through the Core.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Controls: Master the bespoke controller system designed for lightning-fast reactions and fluid movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/77b5e40a02347040c7ed242cb57d4880.poster.avif?t=1749682164\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/77b5e40a02347040c7ed242cb57d4880.webm?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/77b5e40a02347040c7ed242cb57d4880.mp4?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path through waves of digital guardians while the environment itself turns against you. Every level pulses with electric intensity, every firefight becomes a test of agility and timing. The Core wants to keep you. Only a CoreRunner can lead the way out.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKATE. SLASH. SHOOT. SURVIVE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CoreRunner is a high-speed 3rd person runner/shooter that fuses sword and gun combat with luminous light trails to create an entirely unique playstyle. Set in the neon-drenched future of the Core \u2014 a network of spherical worlds designed as digital prisons \u2014 you'll fight your way to freedom across stunning synthwave landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/870dd10d7e0da9594d3c8015e6329746.poster.avif?t=1749682164\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/870dd10d7e0da9594d3c8015e6329746.webm?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/870dd10d7e0da9594d3c8015e6329746.mp4?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary Combat System: Leave snake-like light trails as you skate through arenas, wielding dual swords and dual pistols, with 360\u00b0 attack coverage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aural Experience: Every environment and gameplay sequence crafted around pulsing synthwave tracks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Visual Design: Retrowave aesthetics with vibrant neon lighting and stylized effects that turn combat into visual art.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive Difficulty: Face increasingly hostile patrols and environmental hazards as you progress deeper through the Core.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Controls: Master the bespoke controller system designed for lightning-fast reactions and fluid movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/77b5e40a02347040c7ed242cb57d4880.poster.avif?t=1749682164\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/77b5e40a02347040c7ed242cb57d4880.webm?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/77b5e40a02347040c7ed242cb57d4880.mp4?t=1749682164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path through waves of digital guardians while the environment itself turns against you. Every level pulses with electric intensity, every firefight becomes a test of agility and timing. The Core wants to keep you. Only a CoreRunner can lead the way out.</p>",
